WEBVTT

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.715
Thank you, Daddy.

00:00:06.035 --> 00:00:07.515
Thank you, Daddy.

00:00:07.595 --> 00:00:10.195
(GASPS) Nope. My father said
there's always another way.

00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:13.875
-What? There is no other way.
-Open Ocean. Open Ocean. Hmm...

00:00:13.955 --> 00:00:17.115
Open Ocean. I'm pretty sure
it's the building over there.

00:00:17.195 --> 00:00:20.475
That's ill-defined and roundish.
Like Bailey's head.

00:00:20.635 --> 00:00:22.595
-Wait, what?
-Always another way. There's--

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:26.715
There! Guys, follow me.
I know how we can get to locomotion.

00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:28.235
BOTH: Open Ocean.
DORY: Exactly.

00:00:28.955 --> 00:00:32.555
Um, guys.
You know I can't swim over there, right?

00:00:33.475 --> 00:00:36.235
BOTH: Ooo-roo, ooo-roo, ooo-roo.

00:00:36.475 --> 00:00:38.635
MARLIN: I don't see how this
is going to get us inside.

00:00:38.715 --> 00:00:39.995
What are you even doing?

00:00:40.155 --> 00:00:41.915
We're calling her over, of course.

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:43.835
Calling her over? Calling who over?

00:00:43.915 --> 00:00:45.235
(BIRDS WARBLING)

00:00:48.475 --> 00:00:50.635
Lads, meet Becky.

00:00:50.755 --> 00:00:51.755
(SQUAWKS)

00:00:52.755 --> 00:00:56.475
Flying? No, no, no new information.

00:00:56.675 --> 00:00:58.115
Listen, tell her thank you.

00:00:58.235 --> 00:01:00.395
You guys have gone
above and beyond. Really.

00:01:00.595 --> 00:01:04.795
But is there a way to get in
that involves, like, swimming?

00:01:04.955 --> 00:01:06.235
Because that's really our strength.

00:01:06.435 --> 00:01:09.035
Look, your friend is going to be
in quarantine.

00:01:09.195 --> 00:01:11.115
That's where they take the sick fish.

00:01:11.355 --> 00:01:14.835
And the one and only one way
into that place is Becky.

00:01:14.915 --> 00:01:16.515
-(SQUAWKS)
-(MARLIN SCREAMS)

00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:17.875
(MARLIN CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:19.395
Hi, Becky.

00:01:19.475 --> 00:01:22.315
Ow! Stop. Let's call
her Pecky because this is hurting.

00:01:22.475 --> 00:01:23.835
(CHUCKLES) I think she likes you, Dad.

00:01:23.995 --> 00:01:28.955
Becky, love? These two nice fish
need to get into quarantine.

00:01:29.115 --> 00:01:30.955
Are you free today, Rebecca darling?

00:01:31.075 --> 00:01:34.835
Becky, is-- Would that work
with your schedule? Ow!

00:01:34.995 --> 00:01:36.755
She doesn't understand
what I'm saying.

00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:39.435
All you have to do
is imprint with her, mate.

00:01:39.595 --> 00:01:41.195
-Imp-- What?
-BOTH: Imprint.

00:01:41.355 --> 00:01:45.475
Look her in the eye and say, "ooo-roo"
and she'll be in sync with you.

00:01:45.635 --> 00:01:48.715
-Now look her in the eye.
-Yeah.

00:01:48.795 --> 00:01:52.795
(GROANS) Nemo, I think we should
devise an alternate plan.

00:01:52.955 --> 00:01:55.635
One that involves staying in the water
and someone sane.

00:01:55.795 --> 00:01:58.835
Because this bird, this bird...
This ain't the bird!

00:01:59.035 --> 00:02:01.795
That's fine, Dad. And in the meantime,
Dory will just forget us.

00:02:01.995 --> 00:02:03.835
Like you said, it's what she does best.

00:02:04.035 --> 00:02:05.635
(SIGHS) Fine.

00:02:06.995 --> 00:02:08.075
Uh...

00:02:08.155 --> 00:02:12.595
Okay, look her in the eye. Which eye?

00:02:12.755 --> 00:02:13.995
FLUKE: Just pick one, mate.

00:02:14.155 --> 00:02:14.995
MARLIN: Becky.

00:02:17.075 --> 00:02:18.075
Uh...

00:02:20.315 --> 00:02:24.955
(ECHOING) Ooh. Ooo-roo.
Roo-roo, Becky.

00:02:25.035 --> 00:02:26.035
(SQUAWKS)

00:02:26.595 --> 00:02:27.635
(NEMO LAUGHING)

00:02:27.715 --> 00:02:30.235
Okay, this is all great.

00:02:31.675 --> 00:02:34.595
How exactly is Becky
supposed to carry us?

00:02:34.715 --> 00:02:38.515
Oh yeah. I almost forgot. Gerald!

00:02:38.675 --> 00:02:40.275
-Hmm?
-RUDDER: Yeah, Gerald.

00:02:40.435 --> 00:02:41.835
-FLUKE: Come on, son.
-Hmm?

00:02:42.555 --> 00:02:46.875
Come on, Gerald. Give us your pail,
we'll let you sit on the rock.

00:02:47.035 --> 00:02:49.675
-Yeah, Gerald. We swear it.
-Hmm.

00:02:50.195 --> 00:02:51.435
(LAUGHS)

00:02:51.515 --> 00:02:54.275
That's right. Shimmy on over here.

00:02:54.435 --> 00:02:56.435
-(LAUGHING)
-Come on. You can do it.

00:02:57.195 --> 00:02:58.275
-That's right.
-(GRUNTING)

00:02:58.435 --> 00:02:59.915
Mind you don't scuff your bum.

00:03:00.355 --> 00:03:02.235
(GRUNTING)

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:05.475
-Thank you so much, Gerald.
-(LAUGHING)

00:03:05.635 --> 00:03:08.235
Welcome to your time on this rock.

00:03:09.795 --> 00:03:11.435
-Comfortable, isn't it?
-(CHUCKLES)

00:03:12.555 --> 00:03:13.795
BOTH: Time's up! Get off!

00:03:13.875 --> 00:03:15.635
-Off! Off! Off! Off!
-Time's up! Now get off, Gerald! Off!

00:03:15.755 --> 00:03:20.355
No, this is nuts! Why do I keep getting
talked into insane choices?

00:03:20.475 --> 00:03:21.515
-(BECKY SQUAWKS)
-Good luck!

00:03:22.395 --> 00:03:23.835
(SCREAMING)

00:03:26.315 --> 00:03:27.955
Okay, when I tell you you're gonna--

00:03:28.115 --> 00:03:29.995
Yeah. I know. I'm gonna signal
with a big splash.

00:03:30.155 --> 00:03:34.235
On my mark. Not clear yet.
Not clear yet.

00:03:35.195 --> 00:03:37.435
-Now?
-Not 'til Destiny gives the signal.

00:03:37.915 --> 00:03:38.915
(HANK CHEWING LOUDLY)

00:03:38.995 --> 00:03:42.115
You know something? I have no idea
why you're even doing this.

00:03:43.235 --> 00:03:44.075
What do you mean?

00:03:44.235 --> 00:03:46.075
It seems like a lot of trouble
just to find some more fish.

00:03:46.235 --> 00:03:48.075
If I had short-term memory loss...

00:03:48.235 --> 00:03:50.075
I'd just swim off into the blue
and forget everything.

00:03:50.235 --> 00:03:51.915
Well I don't want to do that.
I want my family.

00:03:52.075 --> 00:03:54.115
Not me, kid. I don't want anyone
to worry about.

00:03:54.675 --> 00:03:58.595
You're lucky. No memories.
No problems.

00:03:58.755 --> 00:04:01.675
Huh. No memories. No problems.

00:04:01.915 --> 00:04:05.195
Still not clear. Still not clear.

00:04:05.355 --> 00:04:06.675
You don't have to say when it's not time.

00:04:06.835 --> 00:04:08.195
-Not--
-Just tell me when it is time.

00:04:08.355 --> 00:04:10.115
Okay, here we go. And-- Wait!

00:04:10.275 --> 00:04:11.955
(INHALES) "Here we go. Wait."
Are you serious?

00:04:12.115 --> 00:04:13.755
-Okay, on the count of three.
-Don't count. Just say, "Go."

00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:15.595
-Go! Now, now. Do it! Do it!
-What? Okay, okay. (GRUNTS)

00:04:16.195 --> 00:04:18.475
-Wow. Look at that! I mean--
-That's the signal.

00:04:18.635 --> 00:04:20.515
-Go, go, go! That's the signal!
-(GRUNTING)

00:04:25.435 --> 00:04:28.195
HANK: Now remember,
Destiny said follow the signs

00:04:28.275 --> 00:04:29.955
-to the Open Ocean exhibit.
-DORY: Uh-huh.

00:04:30.115 --> 00:04:33.635
HANK: I can't see squat,
so it's your job to look for it.

00:04:33.795 --> 00:04:35.635
Got it. Follow the signs to Open Ocean.

00:04:35.795 --> 00:04:36.675
I'm just gonna repeat it, okay?
That should work.

00:04:37.515 --> 00:04:39.995
Follow the signs to Open Ocean.
Follow the signs to Open Ocean.

00:04:40.155 --> 00:04:43.235
Mm. Go right! Follow the signs
to Open Ocean.

00:04:43.395 --> 00:04:46.795
Follow the signs to Open Ocean.
Follow the signs to Open Ocean. Left!

00:04:46.955 --> 00:04:48.875
-Follow the signs to Open Ocean.
-And steer clear of people, will you?

00:04:49.075 --> 00:04:51.235
Especially kids.
I don't want to be touched.

00:04:51.315 --> 00:04:52.875
Sh! Do not mess me up!

00:04:53.355 --> 00:04:55.395
(BOTH SCREAM)

00:04:55.475 --> 00:04:58.915
Oh, poor baby.
Let me get that for you. Here you-- Oh!

00:05:00.395 --> 00:05:01.475
Oh my. Ugh.

00:05:02.555 --> 00:05:04.475
-Where do we go? Where do we go?
-(GIRL CRYING)

00:05:04.675 --> 00:05:07.555
Oh, sorry!
Okay, I was looking, looking...

00:05:07.715 --> 00:05:10.475
MARLIN: Roo-roo, Becky!
Drop us anywhere. We're okay.

00:05:10.595 --> 00:05:13.715
Just wait, Dad. I think she's looking
for a place to land.

00:05:13.875 --> 00:05:17.555
She's confused, Nemo. She doesn't
even know which way to look.

00:05:17.995 --> 00:05:18.995
(GIRL CRYING)

00:05:19.195 --> 00:05:20.235
(SQUAWKS)

00:05:20.355 --> 00:05:21.915
(MARLIN SCREAMING)

00:05:23.995 --> 00:05:27.715
Wait, Becky. What are you doing?
Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo-roo-roo-roo.

00:05:27.795 --> 00:05:28.955
(SQUAWKS)

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:33.035
Okay. I was going somewhere.
The question is where.

00:05:33.195 --> 00:05:34.875
Which way? Do you see the sign?

00:05:35.035 --> 00:05:38.435
I'm looking. I'm looking. Something to
something gets me to my family!

00:05:38.595 --> 00:05:41.155
"The world's most powerful pair of--"

00:05:41.275 --> 00:05:44.275
I know that. Why do I know that?
It's another memory.

00:05:44.435 --> 00:05:47.075
Hank, we need to go that way!
Left. Go left.

00:05:51.195 --> 00:05:53.515
MARLIN: Becky! Ooo-roo. Ooo-roo.

00:05:53.635 --> 00:05:55.875
She can't hear you, Dad.

00:05:55.995 --> 00:05:59.875
All right. New plan. We have to get
closer to Becky so she can hear us.

00:06:00.875 --> 00:06:02.715
-(GRUNTING)
-I don't think we should move the pail.

00:06:03.355 --> 00:06:06.875
Nemo. Without me Becky's lost.

00:06:07.395 --> 00:06:09.075
Dad, just trust her.

00:06:09.155 --> 00:06:12.115
Trust her? So she can forget us
all together?

00:06:12.275 --> 00:06:15.915
-I trust Becky.
-You trust her? Becky's eating a cup!

00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:17.835
(SQUAWKS)

00:06:17.915 --> 00:06:21.235
Becky! Becky! Ooo-roo! Whoa!

00:06:24.555 --> 00:06:26.075
Ah. (GROANS)

00:06:30.475 --> 00:06:32.275
Well, at least we're not stuck
in the bucket anymore.

